actions.aoe_ff+=/cone_of_cold,if=talent.coldest_snap&(prev_gcd.1.comet_storm|!cooldown.comet_storm.ready)&(fight_remains>10|raid)&!cooldown.frozen_orb.ready&cooldown.frozen_orb.remains>10&cooldown.comet_storm.remains>10
